! brief.md — brief, 2026-11-05

Verbatim scratch record `.lares-scratch/controller/terra-unwired-review/brief.md` (brief, file date 2026-11-05); only Markdown transliterated to memetic-wikitext, its words kept as written. Index: [[workshop index|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/workshop/controller/terra-unwired-review/index]].

